              Bodytext: 'Eseguiti ogni frame da config_lifecycle (throttlati internamente). camera_resolver: URL videostreaminTOP dal registro device MQTT. beacon_discovery + beacon_probe (UDP 8899): auto-scoperta di Core (Brokerhost/Corehost) via gaia_beacon, fallback sui valori fissi della pagina Deployment se il beacon non risponde.'
            Settings:
              $t: settings_2
              Mode: annotate
              Backcolorr: [0.325, 0.8, 0.3]
            OP Viewer:
              $t: op_viewer
              Opvieweroversize: natural
            About:
              $t: about
          position: [-70, -190]
          size: [1470, 450]
          color: [0.45, 0.45, 0.45]
          palette_clone: true
