      - name: event_ctrl
        type: baseCOMP
        custom_pars:
          Events:
          - name: Simlevelup
            style: Toggle
            label: Simulate Level Up
            startSection: true
            help: 'Manual test trigger for the level-up bang: flip on then off to simulate gaia/canvas/event/level_up firing, since it has never fired live yet. event_watcher detects this toggle the same way it would detect the real OSC event.'
          - name: Simdreamnew
            style: Toggle
            label: Simulate Dream New
            help: 'Manual test trigger for the dream sequence: flip on then off to simulate gaia/canvas/event/dream_new firing, since it has never fired live yet.'
          - name: Burstamount
            style: Float
            label: Burst Amount
            startSection: true
            default: 0.6
            max: 2.0
            clampMin: true
            help: Peak strength of the level-up celebratory flash, added on top of Washamount into the mood-wash hub. Decays to 0 automatically - never a persistent state change.
            value: 0.342
          - name: Dreamfadeseconds
            style: Float
            label: Dream Fade Seconds
            startSection: true
            default: 4
            min: 0.5
            max: 20.0
            clampMin: true
            normMax: 10.0
            help: Duration in seconds of the crossfade transition into and out of the dream scene.
            value: 0.7799999714
          - name: Dreamholdseconds
            style: Float
            label: Dream Hold Seconds
            default: 20
            min: 1.0
            max: 120.0
            clampMin: true
            normMax: 60.0
            help: Duration in seconds the dream scene stays fully visible before crossfading back to the normal scene.
            value: 5.8000001907
          - name: Recognizeenable
            style: Toggle
            label: Recognize Enable
            startSection: true
            default: true
            help: Master enable for the person-recognition wash (person_recognized/face_enrolled events). Off = no visual reaction even if Gaia sends recognitions.
          - name: Recognizeamount
            style: Float
            label: Recognize Amount
            default: 0.2
            max: 2.0
            clampMin: true
            normMax: 1.5
            help: Opacity multiplier for the recognition wash on top of presence*confidence. Calibrated to match the affinity wash's weight (0.2) - higher blows out the composite (additive stacking).
            value: 1.3200000525
          - name: Simrecognized
            style: Toggle
            label: Simulate Recognized
            help: While ON, feeds a fake person_recognized burst (TestPerson in salotto) into the registry every frame, exactly like a real repeated live recognition - lets you test the wash without a camera. Turn OFF to let it decay naturally.
            value: true
          - name: Plantenable
            style: Toggle
            label: Plant Note Enable
            startSection: true
            default: true
            help: Master enable for the plant_note (AV Herbarium) wash.
          - name: Plantamount
            style: Float
            label: Plant Note Amount
            default: 0.15
            max: 2.0
            clampMin: true
            help: Opacity multiplier for the per-note pluck flash. Kept lower than Recognizeamount since plant_note can fire several times/sec (arpeggiated presets) and compounds visually.
            value: 0.713
