              Titletext: Gaia Canvas Data (parallel schema)
              Bodytext: Extracts the new gaia/canvas/* OSC namespace, mirroring data's select->lag->null pattern. Runs alongside the legacy data COMP (gaia/soul, gaia/rooms, gaia/lights) without replacing it. mood_rgb uses a long (1.2s) lag so scene color never snaps; soul/rooms/lights use short lags matching existing conventions.
