      - name: inhabitants_geo
        type: geometryCOMP
        parameters:
          material: ./pointsprite_inhabitants
        flags:
        - display
        - render
        - viewer
        position: [400, -600]
        size: [160, 130]
        children:
        - name: points1
          type: primitivePOP
          parameters:
            keep: true
            method: set
            setprimtype: points
          custom_pars:
            Points:
              $t: points
          flags:
          - display
          - render
          position: [800, 0]
          inputs:
          - glsl_inhabitants
        - name: annotate1
          type: annotateCOMP
          sequences:
            ext:
            - object: op.TDAnnotate.mod.AnnotateExt.AnnotateExt(me)
              promote: true
          custom_pars:
            Text:
              $t: text
              Titletext: Abstract Inhabitants (per detected object)
              Bodytext: |-
                Same POP+glslPOP-compute+pointsprite pattern as soul_geo/zones_geo. Samples registry/chopto_objects (32 slots: seedNorm/countNorm/alpha/roomNorm per row). Position is fully seed-deterministic (room->angular sector, seed->hash-based jitter) with only a small time-based drift/bob layered on top - identity from the seed, motion never replaces it. Color mixes a seed-derived hue with the live mood color. PointScale fades with the registry's alpha so objects dissolve on disappearance instead of vanishing.

                FIX NOTE: primitivePOP (points1) requires BOTH method=set AND keep=True to actually convert/strip the grid's original quad primitives to points - a fresh primitivePOP defaults to method=none (silently ignoring setprimtype) and keep=False, which left the original grid quad mesh rendering with corners scattered by the compute shader, producing a giant twisted/self-intersecting polygon. This was hard to diagnose because per-point P/Color/PointScale data was completely correct - the bug was purely in leftover primitive connectivity, not the data.
            Settings:
              $t: settings_2
              Mode: annotate
              Backcolorr:
              - '=me.color[0] # node color [r]'
              - =me.color[1]
              - '=me.color[2] '
            OP Viewer:
              $t: op_viewer
              Opvieweroversize: natural
            About:
              $t: about
          position: [-70, -470]
          size: [1070, 730]
          color: [0.45, 0.45, 0.45]
          palette_clone: true
        - name: glsl_inhabitants
          type: glslPOP
          parameters:
            computedat: glsl_inhabitants_compute
            outputattrs: P
          sequences:
            attr:
            - name: color
            - name: pointscale
            vec:
            - name: uMoodR
              valuex: '=tdu.tryExcept(lambda: op(''../data_canvas/null_mood_rgb'')[''gaia/canvas/soul/mood_rgb/r''] / 255.0, 0.5)'
            - name: uMoodG
              valuex: '=tdu.tryExcept(lambda: op(''../data_canvas/null_mood_rgb'')[''gaia/canvas/soul/mood_rgb/g''] / 255.0, 0.5)'
            - name: uMoodB
              valuex: '=tdu.tryExcept(lambda: op(''../data_canvas/null_mood_rgb'')[''gaia/canvas/soul/mood_rgb/b''] / 255.0, 0.55)'
            - name: uTime
              valuex: =absTime.seconds
            sampler:
            - name: objTex
              top: /project1/container1/Visuals/registry/chopto_objects
              filter: nearest
          position: [400, 0]
          inputs:
          - grid_inhabitants
        - name: grid_inhabitants
          type: gridPOP
          parameters:
            cols: 8
            rows: 4
        - name: glsl_inhabitants_info
          type: infoDAT
          parameters:
            op: glsl_inhabitants
          flags:
          - viewer
          position: [475, -120]
          dock: glsl_inhabitants
        - name: pointsprite_inhabitants
          type: pointspriteMAT
          parameters:
            alpha: 0.9
            pointsize: 0.04
            sizingmodel: perspective
            attensizenear: 4
            blending: true
            destblend: one
          position: [400, -400]
        - name: glsl_inhabitants_compute
